### Test 9: Test Task Status Progression
### Start a task and monitor its status changes
POST {{base_url}}/api/enhanced-ai-agents/execute-with-real-time-data
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "agent_id": 1,
  "prompt": "Provide comprehensive growth analysis for my social media presence",
  "context": {
    "agent_type": "growth_advisor",
    "user_id": 1
  },
  "real_time_data": {
    "platforms": ["instagram", "tiktok", "youtube"],
    "current_followers": {"instagram": 50000, "tiktok": 25000, "youtube": 10000}
  }
}

### Wait a few seconds, then check status multiple times
GET {{base_url}}/api/enhanced-ai-agents/task/{{task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Status should progress through:
### - "Initializing AI agent execution..."
### - "Gathering real-time data..."
### - "Getting smart context..."
### - "Executing AI agent with real-time data..."
### - "Formatting response..."
### - "AI agent execution completed successfully"

